<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Resource Hub — Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'resources' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero has-media py-56-64">
  <img class="hero-media" src="media/headers/resources.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async">
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero-title-clamp">Resource Hub</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything in one place — crisis lines, education, self-care tools, and support. No more hunting across five different sites.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-40-8">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid grid-autofit-280">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Find Local Services</h3>
        <p>Search services near you — home care, housing, transport and more — through Senior Resources Online.</p>
        <a class="more" href="https://seniorresourcesonline.com/results/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search local services →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Our Trusted Resources</h3>
        <p>Where we send caregivers when they need more than we can give them ourselves — and what other caregivers told us helped.</p>
        <a class="more" href="trusted-resources.html">See who we trust →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Follow + Learn</h3>
        <p>Good information is hard to find and easy to fake. These are people whose work we think is worth your time.</p>
        <a class="more" href="follow-and-learn.html">Find voices to follow →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Caregiver Tools &amp; Guides</h3>
        <p>Practical things to print, fill in, and take with you — to appointments, to family conversations, to the days that are hard.</p>
        <a class="more" href="caregiver-tools.html">Get the tools →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>FAQ</h3>
        <p>Plain answers to what caregivers ask us most — about caregiving, respite, and how Legacy's programs work.</p>
        <a class="more" href="faq.html">Read the FAQ →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Crisis &amp; Emergency Help</h3>
        <p>If you or the person you care for is in crisis, do not work through this site. Call or text <strong>988</strong> for the Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, or <strong>911</strong> in a medical emergency.</p>
        <a class="more" href="crisis-help.html">Crisis resources →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
